{"step_index":288,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T04:46:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-24T12:46:26+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-24T12:46:30+08:00\nThe search for \"Moomoo Malaysia fee structure Bursa US stocks\" returned the following summary:\nMoomoo Malaysia offers a competitive fee structure for both Bursa Malaysia and US stock trading. While they often run promotions for 0% commission on trades, standard fees typically include commissions, platform fees, and mandatory regulatory charges.\n\n### **Bursa Malaysia Stocks**\nFor trading stocks, ETFs, REITs, and warrants on Bursa Malaysia, the typical fee components are:\n\n*   **Brokerage/Commission Fee:** Moomoo frequently offers 0% commission promotions (verify current status in your app).\n*   **Platform Fee:** RM3.00 per order[1][2][3].\n*   **Clearing Fee:** 0.03% of the transaction value (capped at RM1,000 per contract)[4][5].\n*   **Stamp Duty:** 0.1% of the contract value (capped at RM200 per contract)[5].\n*   **SST:** An 8% Sales and Service Tax is levied on applicable fees (such as brokerage and platform fees)[6].\n\n### **US Stocks**\nTrading US stocks, ETFs, and REITs through Moomoo Malaysia involves the following:\n\n*   **Commission Fee:** Often 0% for promotional periods[7][8]; otherwise, it is typically 0.03% of the transaction amount[9].\n*   **Platform Fee:** $0.99 per order[3][10].\n*   **Regulatory Fees:** US trades are subject to specific regulatory fees (such as Trading Activity Fees and others) which are passed through to the investor[11][12].\n*   **Fractional Shares:** If trading less than 1 share, the platform fee is 0.99% of the trade value (capped at $0.99)[13].\n\n### **Important Notes**\n*   **Promotions:** Moomoo frequently provides \"0% commission\" incentives for new users (e.g., for the first 180 days)[7][8]. Always check the specific terms and conditions in your Moomoo app to see if you qualify for these waivers.\n*   **Variable Charges:** Clearing fees and stamp duties are mandatory regulatory charges set by Bursa Malaysia and are not determined by Moomoo[5].\n*   **Disclaimer:** Fee structures can change. It is recommended to check the **\"Fee Schedule\"** or **\"Help Center\"** section directly within your Moomoo Malaysia app for the most accurate and real-time information regarding your specific account[14][7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [moomoo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYpYbtg5X8aLalAan4On0296zV17AqXbEjv9A2p2EqUeCz22oRqLgkQpNTrTooCsTa7hzkxSjhupjwynxVBR136opPUgOqxJDYcsJbR4505HGqAhOusVuD7XnSBQFvFie8ndQyhlkNIF2nOxvOrx4B1TP_Fb-9RgwRs41tP0fS1rjxiKCMwNWPhuiFG-62mQhXH9LiV_Gkag==)\n[2] [moomoo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-aiVHSA0nnTEfIz301qrgsP4Nw496He5xheudcAPsFMLm85fFhHweDTgIalanQooCf9tZBlrmqMUIjwIlri2GN3y_hEaao4w8RCwyP5AZxrwPHgkjlsT0Nh2IxwKExEMmLg0B2BIo6pKEca99OUA1pUcWHDi12ROGrMkgJElM071ytYYU03as-D06e6r9ORhCdoeepA==)\n[3] [ringgitplus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHlKZWKfj1T6L5Wd8AJRy6BrzcGM5KcxEDaEv4Ay90DKtg_6kNhRMNQc2S-N76V_vhk7j3n7kEYP0HjWwvYSw_5Fpj3uEPZMMUc42ibq9ziAbhTddKSmn6wTEXs4557Fb4y6IRej9s=)\n[4] [moomoo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPjI4tpkbWVOcBQNBQfPP_OAm3evM134yVYS-Z18Gq_XF-f0sM-ys7ZK6J-y1cqrle2bn4sEt-1phO3eR_0flrKmoPv7lzvBzzPze6aiIR1GIDKJBe-Xr6IiGC1ujb-nOeyw==)\n[5] [calculatormalaysia.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGGNLFmd9bzUeJc5q9NLBMxs5BCVWY3kRR1IU18UQ5_gCLJlg_YGZW8Zxg2-QxDqzLthGmzyC7N5wekf-qpz-_5cDd0vGK8vfeEA7fJxzKYqdAc4SMEKbkqmTKcPw7exdlBSdU8NWotTFlypwqwYiJPDOIuOWR4KPSLszk2OV9p7jlKltSG244i)\n[6] [moomoo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFy-cozOpjAgKfv1Kpj5CM6bZCvqW-cxj6AEi4Yg3AYNBCx5mZDrOVw1k1lUxSBeeb1yisrqXs1oKScAzuV4iL5suwHrGhB9fotWESOTD-xkxj4bhDBecO-RkWm6l9xiTNs_w==)\n[7] [moomoo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.goog